# Netlify redirects
# The site uses directory-style output (e.g. /km/index.html, /en/index.html).
# Netlify automatically appends a trailing slash for directories (single,
# non-looping redirect), so explicit de-slash rules are intentionally omitted
# to avoid redirect loops (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS).
# The root "/" serves dist/index.html (the Khmer homepage) directly — no
# redirect needed.
